        "note_tweet": {
          "entities": {},
          "text": "This was my favorite sign at the TDOV rally. I am a leader in my own community. I have been for a very long time. What you see online is only a small fraction of what my advocacy looks like. It’s in real life that I do the most work for the community. Always have always will. \n\nHaving said that, we will not be erased. Just know that there are many people out there who do not agree with what’s happening to the trans community. My advice is to get offline sometime & connect with your local LGBTQ community & allies during these hard times. It’s very grounding. \n\nOnline and real life are not the same thing. Stay strong & much love 🖤🏳️‍⚧️"
        },
